        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"context\":[{\"id\":\"c1\",\"text\":\"Cardiovascular\"},{\"id\":\"c2\",\"text\":\"Cardiovascular products include pacemakers, insertable cardiac monitors, cardiac resynchronization therapy devices, implantable cardioverter defibrillators, leads and delivery systems, products for the treatment of atrial fibrillation, information systems for the management of patients with Electrophysiology Therapy devices, products designed to reduce surgical site infections, coronary and peripheral stents and related delivery systems, balloons and related delivery systems, endovascular stent graft systems, heart valve replacement technologies, cardiac tissue ablation systems, open heart and coronary bypass grafting surgical products, and renal denervation systems for the treatment of hypertension.\"},{\"id\":\"c3\",\"text\":\"Cardiovascular also includes Care Management Services and Cath Lab Managed Services (CLMS) within the Electrophysiology Therapies division.\"},{\"id\":\"c4\",\"text\":\"Cardiovascular's net sales for the three months ended July 31, 2026 were $3.9 billion, an increase of 20 percent, as compared to the corresponding period in the prior fiscal year, resulting from growth across most businesses.\"}],\"filing\":\"MDT 10-Q\",\"section\":\"Part I Item 2\",\"sentences\":[{\"id\":\"s1\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"The graphs below illustrate the percent of Cardiovascular net sales by division for the three months ended July 31, 2026 and July 25, 2025:\"},{\"id\":\"s2\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Electrophysiology Therapies (EPT) net sales for the three months ended July 31, 2026 increased 30 percent as compared to the corresponding period in the prior fiscal year.\"},{\"id\":\"s3\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"The net sales increase was driven by Cardiac Ablation Solutions due to growth in the pulsed field ablation portfolio and Cardiac Rhythm Management due to growth in Cardiac Pacing Therapies and Defibrillation Solutions.\"},{\"id\":\"s4\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Interventional Cardiology Therapies (ICT) net sales for the three months ended July 31, 2026 increased 7 percent as compared to the corresponding period in the prior fiscal year.\"},{\"id\":\"s5\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"The net sales increase was driven by TAVR, Symplicity Spyral renal denervation system, guide catheters and balloons.\"},{\"id\":\"s6\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"CardioVascular Surgery (CVS) net sales for the three months ended July 31, 2026 increased 9 percent as compared to the corresponding period in the prior fiscal year.\"},{\"id\":\"s7\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"The net sales increase was driven by Aortic and growth in Cardiac Surgery due to growth in Avalus Ultra surgical valve and VitalFlow ECMO system.\"},{\"id\":\"s8\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Peripheral Vascular Health (PVH) net sales for the three months ended July 31, 2026 increased 12 percent as compared to the corresponding period in the prior fiscal year.\"},{\"id\":\"s9\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"The net sales increase was driven by growth in Peripheral Vascular and endoVenous.\"},{\"id\":\"s10\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"In addition to the macroeconomic and geopolitical factors described in the Executive Level Overview, looking ahead, we expect Cardiovascular could be affected by the following:\"},{\"id\":\"s11\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Global adoption and growth of Aurora EV-ICD.\"},{\"id\":\"s12\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Growth of the Cobalt and Crome portfolio of ICDs and CRT-Ds.\"},{\"id\":\"s13\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Continued growth and utilization of the TYRX Envelope for implantable devices.\"},{\"id\":\"s14\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"Market acceptance and growth of OmniaSecure defibrillation lead.\"},{\"id\":\"s15\",\"section_path\":\"Part I Item 2 > Cardiovascular\",\"text\":\"OmniaSecure received CE Mark in March 2026.\"}]}"
